{"candidateAnswer":"two years","evidence":"[D2:1 | 2:42 pm on 2 April, 2023] Audrey: Hey Andrew, I got a surprise for you! We adopted another puppy called Pixie. She's SO cute! Isn't she just the cutest?\n[D1:7 | 1:10 pm on 27 March, 2023] Audrey: I've had them for 3 years! Their names are Pepper, Precious and Panda. I can't live without my little ones!","itemId":"urn:uuid:9a507b4c-85dd-57d1-b8e3-5490b225db4a","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:23fc5d2e8ab27a779bf54a95c4800f653867cc8ed80fd6a3304e6154c02cf9ef","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"How many years passed between Audrey adopting Pixie and her other three dogs?","referenceAnswer":"three years","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"23fc5d2e8ab27a779bf54a95c4800f653867cc8ed80fd6a3304e6154c02cf9ef"}}]}